  "instructions": [
    "Wash and dice the tomatoes, slice cucumbers, dice the bell pepper, and thinly slice the red onion.",
    "Roughly chop the pickled gherkins into small pieces.",
    "Whisk together Dijon mustard, apple cider vinegar, olive oil, salt, and pepper to make the dressing.",
    "Toss the tomatoes, cucumbers, bell pepper, onion, and gherkins in the dressing until evenly coated.",
    "Stir in chopped dill and let the salad sit for 5 minutes to meld flavors.",
    "Taste and adjust seasoning with extra salt or pepper if desired.",
    "Serve immediately over a bed of fresh lettuce or alongside warm rye bread.",
    "Optional: drizzle a little extra olive oil before serving for added shine.",
    "Enjoy this quick mustardy Russian tomato salad as a halal-friendly snack or dinner side."
  ],
